  "body": "Hi,\r\n\r\nin Riot i got the problem that when i want to post a sticker i cannot see the preview images but posting them works:\r\n![grafik](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/5631071/54792689-699c1c80-4c3f-11e9-95d2-311956c57e96.png)\r\n\r\nIt seems that the Matrix instance does not accept the option `dynamic_thumbnails`. \r\n\r\n![grafik](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/5631071/54792657-46716d00-4c3f-11e9-97e0-1d6b89ae1854.png)\r\n\r\n\r\nAn example of the image: the first one is not available but the last two are working.\r\n\r\n- https://matrix.fablabchemnitz.de/_matrix/media/r0/thumbnail/t2bot.io/75b451684e4ae0d53427b5c5db2f2953?width=48&height=48&method=scale&animated=true\r\n- https://matrix.fablabchemnitz.de/_matrix/media/r0/thumbnail/t2bot.io/75b451684e4ae0d53427b5c5db2f2953?width=120&height=120&method=scale&animated=true\r\n- https://matrix.fablabchemnitz.de/_matrix/media/v1/thumbnail/t2bot.io/75b451684e4ae0d53427b5c5db2f2953?width=800&height=600\r\n\r\nAs i understand the option the URL should return an image because Matrix should generate a cached image from source by the request with parameters width/height.\r\n\r\nthe image thingy worked once without problems but i dont know which point made the breaking change.\r\n\r\nregards, Mario\r\n",
